<title>USA: Spectranetics names president/CEO.</title>
<headline>Spectranetics names president/CEO.</headline>
<dateline>COLORADO SPRINGS, Colo. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spectranetics Corp said it named Joseph Largey president and chief executive officer. Largey was previously at Picker International, a subsidiary of GEC.</p>
<p>The company was not immediately available for further information.</p>
</text>
